    "title_en": "Perfect state transfer in Grover walks on generalized Bethe trees",
    "abstract_en": "We completely classify the generalized Bethe trees $B(d_0,d_1,\\ldots,d_{n-1})$ that exhibit perfect state transfer between vertex states in Grover walks. We prove that such a tree exhibits perfect state transfer if and only if it is a path or a uniform subdivision of either $B(2,3)$ or $B(1,2,3)$. We also determine all transferring pairs and the minimum transfer times.",
